static/uploads/
# F-27: runtime user uploads must never be committed (photos carry EXIF/GPS and are
# served publicly by /static/<path>). Files already tracked stay tracked; only the
# explicitly allow-listed brand logos may be (force-)added. See kk/tests/test_f27_*.
